:: EN16 16.3.3(6): retain the two independent directional proof obligations.
theorem IffDirections: for x being object holds (x = x iff x is object)
proof
  let x be object;
  thus x = x implies x is object
  proof
    assume x = x;
    thus x is object;
  end;
  thus x is object implies x = x
  proof
    assume x is object;
    thus x = x;
  end;
end;
